PipeRead "yk-applications-menu"

*ToolBox: Colorset 0
*ToolBox: Columns 3
*ToolBox: Frame 1
*Toolbox: Padding 6 4
*ToolBox: ButtonGeometry 64x21+10-10
*ToolBox: (1x3, Swallow "wmclock" `Exec wmclock -led "#ff0067" -12`)
*ToolBox: (2x1, Right, Icon $./images/menu_plus.png, Title (Side, Left) "Applications ", Action (Mouse 1) `Menu YKMenu rectangle $widthx$height+$left+$top +$widthp-5p +1p`)
*ToolBox: (2x1, Title (Side, Left) "Preferences ", Action (Mouse 1) `Menu PrefsMenu rectangle $widthx$height+$left+$top +$widthp-5p +1p`)
*ToolBox: (2x1, Right, Icon $./images/menu_plus.png, Title (Side, Left) "System ", Action (Mouse 1) `Menu SysMenu rectangle $widthx$height+$left+$top +$widthp-5p +1p`)
*ToolBox: (3x1, Left, Swallow stalonetray `Exec stalonetray --parent-bg --icon-size 16 --icon-gravity NW`, Frame -1)

AddToMenu SysMenu
+ "Logout" Exec ykSessionDialog --logout
+ "Reboot" Exec ykSessionDialog --reboot
+ "Shutdown" Exec ykSessionDialog --shutdown
Style ToolBox !Button 1, !Button 2, !Button 3, !Button 4, !Button 5, !Button 6, !Button 7, !Button 8, !Button 9, !Button 0, FixedSize, !Maximizable, !Iconifiable, WindowListSkip, !Handles, Sticky, !Closable. !Destroyable. WindowListSkip, CirculateSkip, !Killable

AddToFunc StartFunction
+ I Module FvwmButtons ToolBox
